        <mxCell id="erd-688" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;Entities&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Generated from the database schema. Every table also has created_at and updated_at, except poll_voters and referendum_voters (no timestamps, so a vote&#x27;s timing can&#x27;t reveal it) and qr_scans (created_at only). Blue lines come from buildings, green from contacts. referendable and replyable are polymorphic, so have no lines. policies.replaces_policy_id points to another policy." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="80" width="1100" x="40" y="10" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
